cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FDOx Registry"
abstract: >-
  A registry for FAIR Digital Objects packaged with the FDOx Squirrel reference
  implementation: harvests FDO metadata published on Zenodo, bundles it into a
  DCAT catalogue anchored in CIDOC CRM, validates it with SHACL, and publishes a
  filter and SPARQL interface as a static site.
